Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): applied on top of the ported
prerequisite "[compiler][objects] Record CompilationKind and
outer_language_mode in ScriptFlags" (cherry-pick-e1ac1f641ab1.patch) so
that Script::CompilationKind::kFunctionConstructor exists. The parser.cc
hunk that switches the eager-compile hint to the
parsing_dynamic_function_declaration_ member is omitted: V8 14.8 has no such
member and its ParsingDynamicFunctionDeclaration() is the same
parameters_end_pos_ check that params_need_validation already captures at
that point. The unittest additions did not apply and were dropped.

